      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Error Trigger\n### What happens:\n- Starts when `compliance_guide_main` fails and receives workflow name, last node, error message and execution link.\n### Why:\n- Failure is noticed at once, not days later.\n### Settings:\n- Linked in the main workflow: Settings -> Error workflow.\n",
        "height": 470,
        "width": 308,
        "color": "#8A2828"
      },
