      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram Alert\n### What happens:\n- Sends workflow name, last node, error text and a link to the run to the owner's chat.\n### Why:\n- The owner sees what failed and can open the run directly.\n",
        "height": 406,
        "width": 308,
