        "content": "## Ping Fail\n### Reports failure to Healthchecks with a short message (workflow, last node, error cut to 300 characters).\n### Why:\n- Healthchecks shows DOWN and alerts too. A second, independent signal.\n### Settings:\n- Custom node, event: Fail (see the note at the main workflow).\n- On Error: Continue.",
